572
01:06:03,465 --> 01:06:07,697
- I can't stand that man.
- He ain't going to be running it.

573
01:06:07,769 --> 01:06:09,862
Well, that's good.

574
01:06:09,938 --> 01:06:12,406
Thanks for the ride.

575
01:06:12,474 --> 01:06:14,738
