a question?

576
01:06:18,914 --> 01:06:21,041
Why did you help me?

577
01:06:22,884 --> 01:06:26,718
- What do you mean?
- When you took us to the hospital.

578
01:06:26,788 --> 01:06:28,722
Why did you do that?

579
01:06:35,063 --> 01:06:37,588
I don't know. I guess--

580
01:06:37,666 --> 01:06:39,327
I just--

581
