586
01:07:10,364 --> 01:07:13,299
I never was
a very good father.

587
01:07:19,406 --> 01:07:21,397
He was a good kid.

588
01:07:25,880 --> 01:07:28,508
I guess that somehow
I just--

589
01:07:31,018 --> 01:07:34,112
when I see what you're going
through there

590
01:07:34,188 --> 01:07:38,522
