right here.

629
01:10:46,212 --> 01:10:49,613
He got his talent
from the old man, I guess.

630
01:10:49,682 --> 01:10:51,047
Didn't he?

631
01:10:51,117 --> 01:10:53,847
That's the only thing
that negro ever gave that boy,

632
