was some drawing.

633
01:10:55,888 --> 01:10:57,856
Taught him
how to draw.

634
01:10:57,924 --> 01:11:01,087
It runs in the family,
sounds like it.

635
01:11:01,160 --> 01:11:02,787
You know...

636
01:11:05,798 --> 01:11:07,857
