637
01:11:07,934 --> 01:11:10,095
He was
a really good kid.

638
01:11:10,169 --> 01:11:12,296
He was so good.

639
01:11:12,371 --> 01:11:13,929
He was--

640
01:11:14,006 --> 01:11:16,702
he really--
he loved me.

641
01:11:16,776 --> 01:11:19,040
He really loved me.

642
01:11:19,112 --> 01:11:20,841
